<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Choice renews cautionary on talks.</title>
<headline>Choice renews cautionary on talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African chicken producer Choice Holdings on Tuesday renewed an earlier cautionary dated June 19, daying the firm was still in talks which if successful could affect its share price.</p>
<p>No further details were given except that shareholders were again advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
